// A sample Mission on Joyride world 2 (xdlrs level new --mode mission --world worlds_\sp_\joyride_\world2): the
// template's gears, key and their objectives removed; its objective (in the Joyride intro box) is the gate down
// the road from the start, before the 40 s clock runs out (won), else lost. No briefing: the alias's (mission 1's)
// is of another world, so the game leaves it out of a level on a world no mission is on.
